{"id":"udachnyj","lemma":"удачный","pos":"adj","rank":4244,"glosses":["successful","fortunate","lucky, prosperous"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1e/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","forms":{"neuter":"удачное","feminine":"удачная","plural":"удачные"},"examples":[{"text":"Это была очень удачная встреча.","en":"It was a very fortunate meeting.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"very"},null,{"g":"meeting, encounter"}]},{"text":"Так вы думаете, что это удачная мысль, да?","en":"And so you think that's a good idea, huh?","words":[{"g":"so"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},null,null,null,{"g":"thought"},{"g":"yes"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"why"]]},{"text":"Момент был выбран не самый удачный.","en":"The timing wasn't very good.","words":[{"g":"moment"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"the very"},null]},{"text":"Она убедила его сделать это, хотя и знала, что идея не очень удачная.","en":"She persuaded him to do it even though she knew it wasn't a good idea.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to convince","l":"убедить"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"although, though"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"idea, thought, notion"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"very"},null]}]}